00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:10.020
cancel out so there's no marble left. The second&nbsp;
line it goes across, up, back down to the third&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:15.420
position, so we have 2 going to 3 and there's&nbsp;
one marble. And then the third line goes up to 2&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:20.580
and across so the third line goes from 3&nbsp;
to 2 and it has three marbles so we cancel- we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:20.580 --> 00:20:29.220
cancel out. So to find a set in these cards we want&nbsp;
the identity permutation in S3 plus an even number&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:29.220 --> 00:20:34.920
of marbles on each strand. Snd so these tiles I&nbsp;
